# Survey Workflow Guardrails

Maintain operator-friendly behavior:

- Keep flow intuitive and state-driven: connect first, then run/survey/export.
- Prefer visuals and concise status over technical/noisy raw protocol output.
- Ensure critical controls are reachable at launch without fullscreen.
- Keep telemetry presentation clear under both dense and readable presets.
- Favor defaults that help field use (multi-monitor HUD, compact corner layout options).
- Any new UI control should have a clear tooltip and predictable persistence.

Do not regress:
- Start/Stop discoverability
- Status clarity
- Quick field-operation ergonomics
